            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "d〔蓊（wěng）蓊郁郁〕形容树木茂盛的样子。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                890,
                436,
                909
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "h〔宛然〕仿佛。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                872,
                658,
                890
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "e〔弥望〕充满视野，满眼。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                105,
                909,
                309,
                927
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "i〔脉（mò）脉〕默默，这里形容水没有声音。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                531,
                890,
                858,
                909
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "page_footnote",
            "content": {
                "page_footnote_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "j〔风致〕美的姿态。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
